sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant SES as Amazon SES

    App->>API: POST /auth/user/register
    API->>DB: save unverified user + code
    API->>SES: email the 6-digit code
    App->>API: POST /auth/user/verify-registration {code}
    API->>DB: emailVerified = true
    App->>API: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: create user_sessions row (token hash)
    API-->>App: JWT (1 h) + refresh token
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/... (Bearer JWT)
    API-->>App: 401 once the JWT expires
    App->>API: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    API->>DB: replace hash, expiresAt = now + 60 days
    API-->>App: new JWT + new refresh token
